 **Edge Cases and Pitfalls:**
-*   **Platform Limitation:** Translucent shadow maps are not available on DirectX 12 with Forward+ or Deferred+ rendering paths. Users must use DirectX 11 or another rendering path [S1, unofficial].
-*   **Front/Back Ambiguity:** Without depth storage, the tint might incorrectly apply to the volume in front of the glass. The translucency map's depth channel resolves this by ensuring only the color behind the glass is applied [S1, unofficial].
